Z||000000||AEmedic||11-18-2001||08:15 PM||||Hey all,<BR>I have an 86 GT w/power locks and the lock cyl disintegrated so I bought a<BR>new set and yesterday started the effort to change them only to find that I<BR>can't seem to get the retaining clip in place between the retaining bosses<BR>and the metal plate (working backwards and blind it seems). Has anyone been<BR>able to achieve this and willing to give advice?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Chris Rogers<BR>86 GT||||reg||5
